=========================================================================
script purpose
  this script create a new database called datawarehouse after checking if it alreadly exist, drop the database and recreate .The script setup three
  schema within the database 'bronze' 'silver' and ' 'gold'

  =============
Warning 
Running this script will drop the entire Datebase 'Datawarehouse' if it already exist and all data in the datawarehouse will be permantently deleted*/


use master;
Go
---drop and recreate the 'datawareahouse' database
If Exists (Select 1 from sys.databases where Name = 'Datawarehouse')

Begin
	Alter Database Datawarehouse Set Single_User with RollBack Immediate;
	Drop Database Datawarehouse;
	End;
	Go
Create Database Datawarehouse;

Use Datawarehouse;

Create SCHEMA bronze;
Go
Create SCHEMA silver;
Go
Create SCHEMA gold;
Go
